OL,3,GNEWSARepeated power cuts are putting my
OL,4,Alife at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who relies on
OL,7,Felectricity-powered medical equipment
OL,8,Fto help her breathe while she sleeps
OL,9,Fsays her life is being put at risk
OL,10,Fbecause of repeated power cuts.
OL,12,FSharon Dudley, who has sleep apnoea and
OL,13,Fuses a CPAP machine to help keep her
OL,14,Fairway open, lives in Lydiard
OL,15,FMillicent, Wiltshire, which has seen
OL,16,Fintermittent power cuts for two weeks.
OL,18,FThe 56-year-old said the longest outage
OL,19,Flasted about 11 hours and her life is
OL,20,Fput at risk during every minute her
OL,21,Fdevice is turned off when she is
OL,22,Fasleep.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
