OL,3,GNEWSARepeated power cuts are putting my
OL,4,Alife at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish and Southern Electricity
OL,7,FNetworks (SSEN) said it has now
OL,8,Fprovided Dudley with a "back-up battery
OL,9,Fpower supply", and the faulty generator
OL,10,Frepair works are expected to be
OL,11,Fcompleted by the end of the week.
